(footprint "TerminalBlock_KF301_5.0-2P_P5.00mm_Horizontal_Mirror"
  (version 20221018)
  (layer "F.Cu")
  (descr "X-mirrored variant (the rear board is drawn as seen from behind in the panel, notes/layout.md): pads and graphics mirrored, courtyard on B.CrtYd. Project copy of the KiCad Phoenix MKDS-1,5-2 footprint for the KF301-5.0-2P (same 5 mm pitch, 1.3 mm drill) with the pads reduced from 2.6 to 2.3 mm so that the pad gap is 2.7 mm and meets the 2.5 mm mains-to-mains clearance (stage 7). Wire entry on the +y side at rot 0. Original: Terminal Block Phoenix MKDS-1,5-2, 2 pins, pitch 5mm, size 10x9.8mm^2, drill diamater 1.3mm, pad diameter 2.6mm, see http://www.farnell.com/datasheets/100425.pdf, script-generated using https://github.com/pointhi/kicad-footprint-generator/scripts/TerminalBlock_Phoenix")
  (tags "THT Terminal Block Phoenix MKDS-1,5-2 pitch 5mm size 10x9.8mm^2 drill 1.3mm pad 2.6mm")
